#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:35 62b88f49259545e0987effa74495fe2a
msgid "转移轨道设计（transfer_design）"
msgstr "Transfer Design (transfer_design)"

#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:37 64a232574e534187a618b636ffe12697
msgid ""
"生成地月转移轨迹，支持 HMN（Hohmann 式）、LGA（月球借力）与 WSB（弱稳定 边界）三类。参数面板按转移类型联动显隐：HMN "
"显示目标地心半径（默认 384400 km，环月演示）；LGA/WSB 需要先在项目树选中一个轨道工件——提交时 自动取其 CR3BP "
"状态末行换算到会合系物理单位注入目标星历，未选中时拦截 提交并提示；LGA 无显式搜索参数时默认注入加密相位网格（360 点）。"
msgstr "Generates cislunar transfer trajectories in three flavours: HMN (Hohmann-like), LGA (lunar gravity assist) and WSB (weak stability boundary). The form shows and hides fields by transfer type: HMN exposes the target geocentric radius (default 384400 km, a circumlunar demo); LGA/WSB require an orbit artifact selected in the project tree — on submission its final CR3BP state row is converted into synodic physical units and injected as the target ephemeris, and submission is intercepted with a hint when nothing is selected; LGA injects a default fine-grained phase grid (360 points) when no explicit search parameters are given."

#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:43 4fcee25e8ac94442bdd1cd497a95673f
msgid ""
"转移结果按 e2m2e ADR 0040 契约解析（会合系质心原点物理 km/km/s、TLI 起算 "
"秒），位置归一后上画布，出发/到达脉冲在时间轴上以 Δv 事件 chip 标注。"
msgstr "Transfer results are parsed per the e2m2e ADR 0040 contract (synodic, barycentric-origin physical km/km/s, seconds since TLI); positions are normalized onto the canvas, and departure/arrival pulses appear on the timeline as Δv event chips."

#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:46 714cf460c1e041d1840ac675f67e9d6c
msgid "分区边界（spatiography_boundaries）"
msgstr "Spatiography Boundaries (spatiography_boundaries)"

#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:48 15e9e7b3fd5e4d62b625cc0150662f70
msgid ""
"返回地月空间分区参照几何（Rosengren et al. 2026 Primer 五省分区：Laplace 半径、SOI/Hill "
"圆族、Battin 曲线、Chebotarev 圆、L3–L5 平动点），经 km→DU "
"归一后作为画布参照图层显示（图表设置可开关）。非轨迹产物、不入轨道库。"
msgstr "Returns the cislunar partition reference geometry (Rosengren et al. 2026 Primer five-province partition: Laplace radius, SOI/Hill circle families, Battin curves, Chebotarev circles, L3–L5 libration points), normalized from km to DU and shown as a canvas reference layer (toggleable in chart settings). Not a trajectory product; not stored in the catalog."

#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:52 f4e9f876ed034ab7a07e14d15a5fd442
msgid "其余工具"
msgstr "Other tools"

#: ../../source/guide/tools.md:54 7a6578814b1246578b509cdf9f3dad67
msgid ""
"17 个工具的 schema 已全部导出（`frontend/src/toolSchemas/`，含 7 个 catalog 操作与 3 "
"个分区解析工具）。任务轨道设计、轨道保持、轨道预报与时空坐标转换的 参数以 schema 为准；轨道稳定性 schema "
"已导出，待上游放开后接入； 参数空间扫描（catalog_sweep）在工具面板直接可用。 catalog 管理操作的 "
"界面分布：查询/取用由目录浏览与画布叠加承担，删除在项目树右键菜单，标注 与族成员提升在记录详情面板，教学案例包导出在过滤栏。需要脚本化工作流时 "
"经 [e2m2e CLI](https://cislunarspace.github.io/e2m2e/) 使用。"
msgstr "All 17 tool schemas are exported (`frontend/src/toolSchemas/`, including 7 catalog operations and 3 spatiography tools). Parameters for orbit design, station keeping, orbit propagation and spacetime transforms follow their schemas; the stability-analysis schema is exported, awaiting an upstream unblock; the parameter sweep (catalog_sweep) is directly available in the tool panel. Catalog management is spread across the UI: query/get serve catalog browsing and canvas overlay, deletion lives in the project-tree context menu, annotation and family-member promotion in the record detail panel, and teaching-case package export in the filter bar. For scripted workflows, use the [e2m2e CLI](https://cislunarspace.github.io/e2m2e/)."

